<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">04. Color</h2>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">Color is a structural part of the <span class="font-logo lowercase">acre&amp;key</span> identity.</p>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">The system is intentionally restrained: <strong>cool architectural neutrals, controlled copper accents, and muted semantic states.</strong></p>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Color should create hierarchy and meaning — never decoration for its own sake.</p>
<div class="space-y-16 font-sans">
