<div class="text-[12px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#BE7555] mb-4">The Principle</div>
<div class="font-serif text-[32px] text-[#FAFAFA] font-normal max-w-4xl leading-[1.3]">A printed <span class="font-logo lowercase">acre&amp;key</span> dossier sitting on a client’s desk should carry the same gravitas and visual authority as a prospectus from Goldman Sachs.</div>
</div>
